id: celestial-potential
name: Celestial Potential
order: 3
category: body
importance: secondary
description: >
  As divine entities entrusted to watch over the fledgling universe, Shinjin have seen the best ways to mitigate their mistakes and capitalize on their successes.
text: >
  Celestial Potential (Body): As divine entities entrusted to watch over the fledgling universe, Shinjin have seen the best ways to mitigate their mistakes and capitalize on their successes.
  (1)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: When you score a Botch Result on a Combat Roll, increase your Dice Score by 2(T) instead of suffering the penalty.
  (2)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: When you score a Critical Dice Result on a Combat Roll, increase your Dice Score by an additional 2(T).
  (3)-[Triggered/Power, 1/Encounter]: You may convert up to 2 of your Counter Actions into Actions.

---

# (1) Armed from the Traits tab: the next Botch on a Combat Roll - its penalty not taken, 2(T) added instead (chat.mjs
# rollSide).
[triggered/botch, 1/round]
roll.total += 2(T);

# (2) Armed: the next Critical on a Combat Roll - 2(T) more on top of its Critical Extra Dice.
[triggered/critical, 1/round]
roll.total += 2(T);

# (3) Offered in a window as the Power Up Maneuver is used: as many of your Counter Actions as are left, up to 2,
# become Actions this Combat Round.
[triggered/power, 1/encounter]
actions.fromCounter += min(2, actions.counterLeft);
